{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44935","headline":"杼山禅居寄赠东溪吴处士冯一首 · 皎然","name":"杼山禅居寄赠东溪吴处士冯一首","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青云何润泽，下有贤人隐。\n路入菱湖深，迹与黄鹤近。\n野风吹白芷，山月摇清轸。\n诗祖吴叔庠，致君名不尽。\n身当青山秀，文体多郢声。\n澄澈湘水碧，泬寥楚山青。\n时人格不同，至今罕知名。\n昔贤敦师友，此道君独行。\n既得庐霍趣，乃高雷远情。\n别时春风多，扫尽雪山雪。\n爲君中夜起，孤坐石上月。\n悠然遗尘想，邈矣达性说。\n故人不在兹，幽桂惜未结。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}